WEBVTT

00:16.880 --> 00:19.410
Pardon me for that undignified display.

00:19.740 --> 00:24.390
Don't worry about it. 
You've never been so talkative before.

00:24.390 --> 00:26.900
You're teasing me, Master.

00:27.950 --> 00:30.130
Do your hands still hurt?

00:30.730 --> 00:33.880
Come to think of it,
 the pain seems to have gone away.

00:37.360 --> 00:38.510
The wounds...

00:38.930 --> 00:40.800
Did you do this, Nephy?

00:40.800 --> 00:41.680
I think so.

00:42.260 --> 00:44.690
<i>Just from touching her?</i>

00:44.690 --> 00:46.970
<i>So this is the power of mysticism.</i>

00:47.620 --> 00:49.730
<i>It's much more potent than healing sorcery.</i>

00:50.250 --> 00:52.990
Impressive. Thank you, Nephy.

00:52.990 --> 00:55.360
Daze

00:54.390 --> 00:55.360
What's wrong?

00:56.130 --> 00:59.950
That's the first time you've said that to me.

00:59.950 --> 01:04.040
<i>Does that mean I hadn't said a 
single word gratitude to her?!</i>

01:04.880 --> 01:07.480
That's... Sorry.

01:07.480 --> 01:08.210
It's okay.

01:08.510 --> 01:11.450
You're my master, after all.

01:21.610 --> 01:23.890
Nephy? Is something wrong?

01:26.070 --> 01:28.770
Well, Master...

01:30.600 --> 01:34.530
Would you... like to sleep with me?

03:06.990 --> 03:12.000
<b>Next Time:
When An Archdemon Offers You Anything,
You're Better Off Saying No</b>

03:12.640 --> 03:15.000
Sleep... with you?

03:19.280 --> 03:23.140
<i>I'm a man, and Nephy's a woman, which 
would imply... Is she trying to say—</i>

03:26.430 --> 03:30.590
Nephy. Do you understand what you're saying?

03:30.590 --> 03:34.500
Yes. This castle has only one bed, so...

03:36.530 --> 03:37.400
Bwuh?

03:37.710 --> 03:42.080
You always sleep in that chair.

03:42.080 --> 03:45.870
I think you'd be able to rest 
better if you laid down.

03:46.260 --> 03:48.870
So I thought you could join me...

03:48.870 --> 03:53.370
<i>Oh, it's not that she's 
making physical overtures,</i>

03:53.370 --> 03:56.410
<i>she genuinely wants to share 
a bed for sleeping purposes.</i>

03:56.410 --> 03:57.880
<i>So very pure...</i>

03:58.210 --> 04:01.290
Nephy, I appreciate your concern,

04:01.290 --> 04:03.750
but this is the anchor point of my barriers.

04:03.750 --> 04:07.300
Should anything happen, 
it's important that I'm in this room.

04:07.690 --> 04:10.310
I thought that might be the case.

04:10.730 --> 04:11.810
Which is why—

04:12.930 --> 04:15.310
Please, use my lap.

04:16.000 --> 04:19.650
<i>Is she offering me a lap pillow?!</i>

04:20.430 --> 04:25.420
<i>Well, obviously, I can't turn that down!</i>

04:29.770 --> 04:31.290
Are you comfortable?

04:31.720 --> 04:33.980
I-It's not bad.

04:33.980 --> 04:37.130
<i>What is this mixture of 
embarrassment and comfort?</i>

04:38.700 --> 04:40.960
<i>To say nothing about the very imposing view.</i>

04:41.380 --> 04:43.810
I'm curious, what brought this on?

04:46.240 --> 04:49.160
You said it was all right for me to stay here

04:49.160 --> 04:51.850
after learning about my mysticism.

04:51.850 --> 04:54.730
I wanted to show my gratitude.

04:55.090 --> 04:57.680
Thanks aren't necessary.

04:57.680 --> 05:00.140
You've already been doing a great job.

05:00.140 --> 05:01.190
Okay.

05:03.500 --> 05:07.280
Say, Nephy, are you interested 
in learning sorcery?

05:07.610 --> 05:09.160
You think I could?

05:09.630 --> 05:13.980
Based on what I saw today, you don't have 
a lot of control over mysticism, do you?

05:15.150 --> 05:19.460
Considering how much power you displayed, 
in spite of a mana-limiting collar...

05:19.460 --> 05:24.610
I'm not certain that learning sorcery 
would help you get a handle on mysticism,

05:24.610 --> 05:26.970
but you could at least use 
it to defend yourself.

05:26.970 --> 05:29.850
Will I really be able to?

05:29.850 --> 05:35.250
Of course. I get the feeling 
you'll be even better at it than I am.

05:35.250 --> 05:39.250
Will it... help me be of use to you?

05:39.250 --> 05:42.060
You're already a great help.

05:42.060 --> 05:46.550
Would I... be able to protect you, Master?

05:46.550 --> 05:49.570
You just protected me from the 
Angelic Knights, remember?

05:52.190 --> 05:53.200
I'll do it.

05:53.200 --> 05:56.750
I want to learn sorcery to help you, Master.

05:57.060 --> 06:00.520
<i>I would've preferred she did 
it for her own sake, but...</i>

06:00.520 --> 06:03.630
In that case, Nephy, 
you're now my apprentice.

06:03.910 --> 06:04.880
Right.

06:05.200 --> 06:07.460
<i>An apprentice, huh...</i>

06:07.460 --> 06:10.060
<i>I never even thought 
about having one until now.</i>

06:10.060 --> 06:13.940
<i>Entrusting the knowledge and techniques 
I've gathered to someone else...</i>

06:13.940 --> 06:15.870
Excuse me, Master?

06:16.760 --> 06:19.350
In the story you mentioned earlier,

06:19.350 --> 06:24.690
you made it sound like your power meant 
you didn't understand how the weak feel...

06:25.390 --> 06:28.700
Are weak people not even allowed to live?

06:28.700 --> 06:31.450
Does flaunting your strength
really make you so great?!

06:32.230 --> 06:34.380
<i>I guess I did mention that.</i>

06:34.950 --> 06:38.290
You made it sound like it didn't mean much...

06:38.590 --> 06:41.330
But I think it must've been painful for you.

06:43.250 --> 06:45.130
Why do you think that?

06:45.130 --> 06:46.460
I don't know.

06:47.020 --> 06:50.300
But when you were talking about it,

06:50.300 --> 06:52.800
you looked very sad.

06:56.300 --> 06:59.520
You're not a bad person, Master.

07:00.060 --> 07:06.310
You might not talk much, but I will never 
forget how kindly you've treated me.

07:06.310 --> 07:07.770
I see.

07:07.770 --> 07:08.560
Yes.

07:09.350 --> 07:12.510
<i>This isn't bad at all.</i>

07:14.600 --> 07:19.040
<i>It'd be nice if we could 
have more moments like this.</i>

07:23.100 --> 07:25.340
Whoa, whoa, whoa, what the hell?!

07:27.550 --> 07:32.190
I heard you had Angelic Knights 
sicced on you! How are you fine?!

07:32.190 --> 07:35.390
How should I know? 
They're the ones who were weak.

07:35.740 --> 07:39.220
I heard one of them even had a Sacred Sword.

07:42.560 --> 07:44.980
I guess that is true, actually.

07:46.020 --> 07:48.650
So even the Maiden of the 
Sacred Sword wasn't a threat to you?

07:48.650 --> 07:51.510
No, she was pretty strong.

07:51.510 --> 07:54.350
She managed to destroy a few of 
the barriers around the castle.

07:54.350 --> 07:58.610
Speaking of, could you please stop breaking 
through them whenever you show up?

07:58.610 --> 07:59.500
Here you are.

08:00.070 --> 08:02.750
Help yourself to as much 
milk and sugar as you like.

08:03.950 --> 08:06.250
Yeah, thank—

08:10.300 --> 08:13.520
W-Whoa! That's the elf from before, right?

08:13.520 --> 08:14.390
Or not?

08:14.390 --> 08:17.180
No, it's definitely the same girl as before.

08:17.570 --> 08:20.200
You haven't used her as a sacrifice yet?!

08:20.200 --> 08:25.040
Wait, don't tell me. You're letting her 
live for as long as she serves you?!

08:25.040 --> 08:26.820
Damn, that's nasty!

08:26.820 --> 08:28.480
No. I'm not you.

08:30.120 --> 08:33.670
Nephy is my... well, my apprentice.

08:34.320 --> 08:37.280
A-An apprentice? You?!

08:37.280 --> 08:38.490
Something wrong with that?

08:38.850 --> 08:41.410
There are sorceries who are 
hard to handle on your own.

08:41.410 --> 08:43.790
Nephy will come in handy.

08:43.790 --> 08:45.370
Thank you, sir.

08:46.410 --> 08:47.840
I get it.

08:47.840 --> 08:51.340
Using an elf, there's probably no 
sorcery that you can't pull off.

08:51.340 --> 08:54.340
The idea never occurred to me.

08:54.340 --> 08:56.850
<i>He's talking about her like she's an object.</i>

08:56.850 --> 09:00.930
<i>I do it sometimes, too, but hearing it 
from someone else is ticking me off!</i>

09:01.270 --> 09:04.880
Wait, is her power how you chased 
off the Angelic Knights, too?

09:04.880 --> 09:07.690
She did have a hand in that, yes.

09:08.740 --> 09:11.820
I guess that explains the mess outside.

09:14.320 --> 09:17.390
You're after one of the 
Archdemon seats, aren't you?

09:18.500 --> 09:21.360
<i>All I really wanted was the key, but...</i>

09:21.360 --> 09:25.660
<i>With an Archdemon's authority, fewer 
people would risk coming after Nephy.</i>

09:26.250 --> 09:28.670
Why wouldn't I be?

09:33.810 --> 09:37.300
<i>The truth is, I'm unlikely 
to be chosen right now.</i>

09:37.890 --> 09:42.430
<i>It's only been a decade since 
I began studying sorcery.</i>

09:42.800 --> 09:46.640
<i>There are others who have been doing 
it for several hundred years.</i>

09:46.640 --> 09:50.810
<i>In terms of accumulated knowledge and 
experience, I simply can't compare.</i>

09:51.110 --> 09:56.070
<i>But as long as I stay alive, there's always 
a chance I can take the next open seat.</i>

09:57.140 --> 10:00.010
This goes well with the 
black tea. Very tasty.

10:00.010 --> 10:02.490
I'm thrilled to hear it, Master.

10:02.890 --> 10:07.210
Zagan, you haven't gotten 
attached to this girl, have you?

10:07.210 --> 10:10.890
Is it that strange value one's apprentice?

10:11.740 --> 10:14.090
<i>Man, being able to call 
her that is so convenient!</i>

10:15.260 --> 10:16.850
I get it!

10:16.850 --> 10:19.680
I guess you've still got some 
humanity intact, after all.

10:20.010 --> 10:21.430
Give it a rest.

10:22.280 --> 10:24.310
What, are you leaving already?

10:24.670 --> 10:25.690
Yep.

10:27.640 --> 10:30.100
What did he even come here for?

10:30.100 --> 10:31.970
Aren't you friends?

10:31.970 --> 10:33.190
Friends?!

10:33.720 --> 10:35.610
Don't be ridiculous.

10:35.610 --> 10:40.150
You need to choose your friends carefully 
or they'll only become nuisances.

10:40.150 --> 10:42.770
But you seemed to be having a good time.

10:43.880 --> 10:45.210
I did?

10:45.210 --> 10:46.240
Yes.

10:46.600 --> 10:49.620
<i>Do I enjoy talking with that idiot?</i>

10:51.400 --> 10:54.670
<i>That's absurd! Nephy's just mistaken.</i>

10:56.010 --> 11:00.840
Now, then, it's time to repair the 
barriers damaged by the Angelic Knights.

11:02.710 --> 11:04.220
Come along, Nephy.

11:04.220 --> 11:07.040
This is a good chance to teach you the 
fundamentals of sorcerous circles.

11:07.040 --> 11:09.270
Yes, Master.

11:11.190 --> 11:15.690
<i>From that point on, Nephy worked 
hard on her sorcery lessons</i>

11:16.280 --> 11:19.150
<i>while also attending to the castle.</i>

11:31.280 --> 11:33.580
<i>Not being alone...</i>

11:34.070 --> 11:36.390
<i>is somehow sweeter than I had anticipated.</i>

11:36.390 --> 11:37.550
<i>Much more than I expected.</i>

11:38.100 --> 11:42.800
<i>And, little by little, 
Nephy began to express herself more.</i>

11:48.170 --> 11:49.730
<i>As for mysticism...</i>

11:50.480 --> 11:53.310
<i>She seems to still have
trouble controlling it.</i>

12:01.420 --> 12:04.170
You can use some decent sorcery now.

12:04.940 --> 12:06.500
Thank you!

12:06.500 --> 12:08.910
In that case, I'll see to preparing lunch.

12:09.410 --> 12:10.150
Right.

12:10.830 --> 12:13.670
<i>Now if I could just get rid of that collar...</i>

12:16.400 --> 12:20.760
<i>And before I knew it, I had been 
living with Nephy for a month.</i>

12:40.160 --> 12:41.990
Well, this is a shock.

12:42.400 --> 12:45.990
It seems the 12 Archdemons 
are calling for me.

12:45.990 --> 12:50.990
<b>An Archdemon's Dilemma:
How to Love Your Elf Bride</b>

12:51.940 --> 12:54.830
<i>The trading hub, Kianoides.</i>

12:55.590 --> 13:00.560
<i>Underneath this town are ruins used as a
 lair by the late Archdemon, Marchosias.</i>

13:13.920 --> 13:18.520
<i>This is where the 12 current 
Archdemons have all gathered,</i>

13:18.520 --> 13:20.440
<i>and are waiting for me.</i>

13:21.350 --> 13:25.030
<i>The question is, what do they want?</i>

13:40.880 --> 13:42.840
You must be Zagan.

13:44.370 --> 13:48.090
I had heard you were young, 
but you're an actual child.

13:49.250 --> 13:50.400
Interesting.

13:50.400 --> 13:52.850
The youngest to ever be chosen, then.

13:53.200 --> 13:54.680
<i>Oh, come on...</i>

13:54.680 --> 13:57.560
<i>I feel like throwing up from pressure 
and the intensity of their mana.</i>

13:58.000 --> 14:01.060
<i>Forget being in the sights of a snake,</i>

14:01.360 --> 14:04.110
<i>it feels like I'm in one's stomach already.</i>

14:04.560 --> 14:08.110
<i>These are the apex sorcerers, the Archdemons!</i>

14:10.020 --> 14:13.140
Was I summoned just to be gawked at?

14:13.140 --> 14:16.330
Because if so, does that mean I can go?

14:20.210 --> 14:24.240
You've quite the nerve to 
take that tone with us.

14:24.240 --> 14:26.510
Let's spare the pleasantries, then.

14:27.420 --> 14:34.970
Sorcerer Zagan, you have been chosen to 
be our 13th comrade, an Archdemon.

14:43.180 --> 14:46.780
This is the Archdemon brand 
that Marchosias left behind.

14:47.110 --> 14:52.660
Taking the seat of an Archdemon is the 
process of acquiring one of these emblems.

14:54.820 --> 14:57.000
<i>What the hell is that emblem?!</i>

14:57.000 --> 14:59.560
<i>The density and quantity of mana is absurd!</i>

14:59.560 --> 15:01.040
<i>And I'm going to inherit it?</i>

15:01.710 --> 15:04.780
<i>I can feel a similar power 
from everyone else here.</i>

15:05.280 --> 15:09.670
<i>I see, so being an Archdemon 
isn't just a title you earn.</i>

15:10.140 --> 15:12.190
<i>Considering the kind of power they wield,</i>

15:12.190 --> 15:15.220
<i>I can see why ordinary sorcerers 
are powerless against them.</i>

15:17.440 --> 15:19.430
What's wrong? Something not to your liking?

15:19.920 --> 15:22.300
Not really, other than this 
doesn't make much sense.

15:22.300 --> 15:25.440
There are sorcerers much 
more powerful than I am.

15:27.170 --> 15:29.270
A natural doubt to have.

15:29.270 --> 15:31.790
Your power is still insignificant.

15:31.790 --> 15:35.450
But despite that, there is 
no sorcerer who can kill you.

15:37.280 --> 15:40.510
The first sorcerer you killed...

15:40.510 --> 15:44.250
Andras the Accursed was by no means weak.

15:47.840 --> 15:51.510
And yet despite that, you were 
able to turn the tables on him,

15:51.510 --> 15:54.120
taking his life and all his knowledge.

15:54.120 --> 15:56.320
How is it that an eight-year-old boy

15:56.320 --> 15:59.770
was able to strike down a sorcerer 
who had earned a second name?

16:00.840 --> 16:02.020
You...

16:02.390 --> 16:05.770
were able to learn his sorcery 
with a single glance.

16:08.000 --> 16:13.070
Not just that, but you grasped its 
function in that single moment.

16:13.760 --> 16:17.410
That is why you were able to 
construct wholly unique sorcery.

16:18.640 --> 16:22.040
<i>Well, so much for my secret weapon.</i>

16:22.720 --> 16:24.980
Your sorcery is worthy of awe.

16:24.980 --> 16:27.290
Your talents? Worthy of resentment.

16:27.710 --> 16:32.790
Should you decide to take from others,
 none would be able to stop you.

16:32.790 --> 16:38.050
Should you decide to kill, 
none would be able to survive.

16:38.530 --> 16:40.840
Should you crave it,

16:40.840 --> 16:44.480
all others would have little choice but to 
surrender their sorcery to you.

16:45.060 --> 16:48.400
A tyrannical power, fitting for an Archdemon.

16:48.780 --> 16:53.550
In time, you will become the 
greatest sorcerer in all history.

16:53.550 --> 16:57.280
Which is why you will be made an 
Archdemon now, despite your fledgling status.

16:57.950 --> 17:00.380
All is for the sake of knowledge.

17:00.380 --> 17:03.040
All so that we may master sorcery.

17:03.780 --> 17:09.040
If what you're saying is true, that'd mean 
I could take from all of you, wouldn't it?

17:13.110 --> 17:16.000
Indeed. But mind yourself, boy.

17:16.000 --> 17:18.300
Know that we could take much more from you

17:18.300 --> 17:22.980
than you would be able to take from us.

17:27.430 --> 17:31.190
An Archdemon's wrath is nothing 
as simple as destruction.

17:31.190 --> 17:33.500
It is an erasure of all things
 you have ever known,

17:33.500 --> 17:39.490
be they man, material, or memory, 
until your very existence is no more.

17:41.410 --> 17:45.470
That is the nature of the beings you face.

17:45.470 --> 17:50.290
And the nature of what you 
will become, yourself.

17:50.820 --> 17:53.070
There will be no peace, no tranquility.

17:53.070 --> 17:56.450
From the shadows of sorcery, 
into the an even darker abyss.

17:56.450 --> 18:00.990
A pitch-black void where not even a 
single ray of light will penetrate.

18:00.990 --> 18:04.620
That is the world that is calling to you.

18:07.920 --> 18:09.150
Like I didn't know.

18:09.730 --> 18:11.680
<i>From the moment I became a sorcerer...</i>

18:11.680 --> 18:14.900
<i>Well, the moment I was forced to become one,</i>

18:14.900 --> 18:17.530
<i>I knew a normal life was out of the question.</i>

18:18.140 --> 18:21.340
<i>The final destination for a 
sorcerer is one of two outcomes.</i>

18:21.340 --> 18:25.180
<i>Become one of them, or die in obscurity.</i>

18:25.180 --> 18:27.330
<i>Turning back was never an option.</i>

18:28.100 --> 18:33.170
<i>But... can I really drag 
Nephy into that darkness?</i>

18:37.160 --> 18:39.380
I would have your answer.

18:40.410 --> 18:42.970
There is something I want.

18:45.910 --> 18:48.100
If I can have it, then I'll accept.

18:49.790 --> 18:51.450
What is it you wish?

18:53.630 --> 18:55.080
Very well.

18:55.080 --> 18:58.030
Do what you will with all of it.

18:58.420 --> 19:02.210
In that case, I humbly accept 
the position of Archdemon.

19:06.770 --> 19:09.680
Let us welcome our new comrade...

19:09.680 --> 19:11.000
Archdemon Zagan!

19:14.720 --> 19:17.020
And let us grant him his second name.

19:17.590 --> 19:19.760
You will be known as...

19:25.770 --> 19:28.350
Welcome home, Master!

19:28.630 --> 19:30.690
Tonight will be lamb stew...

19:32.090 --> 19:35.150
Master, did something happen?

19:35.970 --> 19:38.690
<i>I've been on a road where 
there's no turning back.</i>

19:39.200 --> 19:40.450
<i>But Nephy...</i>

19:40.730 --> 19:43.700
<i>She's finally got a chance to live 
something resembling a normal life.</i>

19:44.980 --> 19:46.160
Nephy.

19:46.550 --> 19:48.330
I've become an Archdemon.

19:50.560 --> 19:52.080
They're the lords of sorcery.

19:52.480 --> 19:56.460
Other sorcerers have to obey them. 
They stand atop the rest.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.170
Congratulations!

19:59.740 --> 20:01.670
As part of my appointment,

20:02.250 --> 20:04.710
I've obtained all of Marchosias' property.

20:06.170 --> 20:07.220
Which means...

20:14.750 --> 20:16.810
I can remove that collar.

20:29.510 --> 20:31.960
M-Master, are you saying...

20:32.580 --> 20:33.330
Yes.

20:35.650 --> 20:39.090
As an Archdemon, I have no more use for you.

20:39.450 --> 20:40.790
Please leave.

20:48.790 --> 20:49.600
Huh?

20:50.360 --> 20:55.100
<i>What am I doing out here again?</i>

20:55.850 --> 20:59.730
<i>I remember... I was preparing dinner...</i>

21:00.350 --> 21:06.660
<i>It was lamb stew. 
Master had loved it before...</i>

21:07.510 --> 21:10.200
<i>I wanted to see him make the same face.</i>

21:10.930 --> 21:14.020
<i>I had better hurry back...</i>

21:22.970 --> 21:24.670
<i>Oh, right.</i>

21:26.120 --> 21:30.390
<i>Master got rid of me.</i>

21:30.870 --> 21:33.060
So for now, you'll live for my sake.

21:33.650 --> 21:35.520
Do as you wish, Nephy.

21:36.160 --> 21:37.350
My point is, Nephy...

21:37.350 --> 21:39.250
Don't make that face.

21:39.250 --> 21:41.290
I already told you I needed you, didn't I?

21:45.000 --> 21:50.220
<i>I'm surprised that I'm not crying, 
in spite of what's happened.</i>

21:51.470 --> 21:55.550
<i>After he said I could stay with him...</i>

23:30.050 --> 23:35.050
<b>Next Time:
Heartbreak Can Be Literally, Physically Painful</b>
